### Run an instrumented triage request (server prints a paste-ready trace)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How do I change my HSA contribution?", "userId": 42 }

### Rolling P50 / P95 / P99 + last trace in Lab + JSON formats
GET http://localhost:3001/debug/latency

### Multi-agent NexusAgent request (orchestrator → research ∥ compliance → writer)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "request": "Summarize Q2 vendor risk for the audit committee" }

### Merged swim-lane trace for a specific traceId
GET http://localhost:3001/debug/latency/trace?id=REPLACE_WITH_TRACE_ID

### Recent SLO alerts (diagnosis-enriched, newest first)
GET http://localhost:3001/debug/alerts

### OTLP JSON for the last trace (curl this straight to an OTLP/HTTP collector)
GET http://localhost:3001/debug/otlp
